Yulip
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
RUVU 8 FACE_LAST
RUVU 10 FACE_LAST
RUVU 4 FACE_LAST

UBAEZ 4 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE_STACK RUVU UBAEZ
AND
    OR
        SRCSTACK Suit match
        DEST Empty
    SRCSTACK Suit alternate_color
MOVE_STACK UBAEZ UBAEZ
AND
    DESTSRC Rank ascending
    OR
        DEST Empty
        DEST Empty
$win
PILE ALL RUVU Empty
